{:id       :isaac.agent.schema-ownership
 :version  "0.0.0"
 :builtin? true
 :factory  isaac.foundation.module.protocol/module
 :description "Test-only schema fragments so configurator ownership specs see snapshot-only entity collections on the server classpath."

 ;; isaac-mdj2: :crew, :models, :providers, and :comms used to be faked here
 ;; because isaac-http's pinned isaac-agent/isaac-foundation predated
 ;; isaac-6pqo/isaac-h2oo, which moved those tables (and the :comms
 ;; factory/berth) to isaac-agent for real. Now that this repo's pins are
 ;; past both, isaac-agent provides all four on the classpath and faking
 ;; them here collided (isaac-http's own manifest already dropped its
 ;; duplicate :comms schema in isaac-6pqo). Only :lantern — a fixture with
 ;; no real owner — remains.
 :isaac.config/schema
 {:lantern   {:schema {:name        :lantern
                       :type        :map
                       :description "Test-only: the lantern fixture issuer's door, for OIDC trust rules that point at config."
                       :schema      {:push {:type   :map
                                            :schema {:endpoint        {:type :string}
                                                     :service-account {:type :string}}}}}}}}